 (("1"
   "The principal executive offices of the Issuer are located at 94 Pitts Bay Road, Pembroke, Bermuda HM 08.")
  ("2"
   "The Reporting Persons are filing this statement jointly with respect to the same securities as contemplated by Rule 13d-1(k)(1), not as members of a group.")
  ("3"
   "On December 1, 2024, Mr. Hagen and Ms. Hagen each acquired 57,174 Ordinary Shares from the vesting and settlement of certain RSUs issued prior to the IPO under the Plan.")
  ("4"
   "The Reporting Persons acquired the securities described in this Schedule 13D for investment purposes and they intend to review their investments in the Issuer on a continuing basis.")
  ("5"
   "During the past 60 days, except as described in Item 3, the Reporting Persons have not engaged in any transaction with respect to Ordinary Shares.")
  ("6"
   "On November 22, 2024, 100% of the warrants vested and became exercisable upon the satisfaction of the per share price hurdles described above.")
  ("7"
   "Joint Filing Agreement, dated December 2, 2024, by and among the Reporting Persons."))
